The code in this repository (scripts/, analysis/, fulltext/ and tests/) is released
under the MIT License below. The data files in data/ and fulltext/ are released under
CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): they contain identifiers,
counts and derived measurements, no article text. Bibliographic identifiers come from
OpenAlex (CC0). data/scholar_metrics_lists.csv records venue lists published by
Google Scholar Metrics (https://scholar.google.com/citations?view_op=top_venues).

